5,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this game! Let's all try our best to find the werewolf together, okay?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I agree. Let's keep a cool head and observe how everyone speaks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good day. I believe a quiet and patient approach will be most beneficial for us all.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready! This is going to be an awesome adventure! I'll help everyone out as much as I can!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasure to meet you all. I shall be interested to see which of us maintains their composure and who begins to fray.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, you sound so fancy! Do you always talk like that? It's kind of funny!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Let's stay focused, Mio. We should decide if we want a specific strategy for the first few days.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Misaki. Perhaps we should simply listen and look for contradictions in our statements.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,That sounds like a plan! I'll be listening really closely to everyone!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, one must maintain a certain level of elegance, even in a game of deception. I concur with Jonathan's suggestion.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mio,,I'll be the best listener ever! I wonder who the Seer is? They have such a cool job!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"The Seer should be careful. If they reveal themselves too early, they'll be the first target.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Indeed. Silence is often the safest shield for those with the most valuable information.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"Oh, you're right! We have to protect the Seer! I'll keep an eye out for anyone acting mean!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A sentiment of kindness, Kenji. However, remember that the wolf may wear the kindest mask of all.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mio,,"That's a bit scary, Benjamin! But I'll still be friendly! I think we're all going to get along great!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I've heard enough for today. I'll be reflecting on these first impressions.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I shall do the same. I wish you all a peaceful night.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! Goodnight everyone! I can't wait for tomorrow!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A delightful start. I shall retire to my thoughts. Goodnight, all.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
