35,1,1,talk,Mio,,Good morning! Did everyone sleep well? I wonder if the Seer found anything spooky last night!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Good morning. Now that the first divination is done, I wonder if anyone is ready to share information.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning. It is a heavy burden to speak first, but for the sake of the village, I must reveal that Mio is the werewolf.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! Mio is the wolf? No way! She's so cheerful! Are you sure, @Jonathan?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A bold claim right at the start. Jonathan, you've identified yourself as the Seer and pointed a finger immediately.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Mio,,"What?! @Jonathan, that's not true! I'm just a regular girl! Why would you say that? I'm so sad!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"This is a critical moment. If Jonathan is the Seer, the game ends today. If he's the wolf, he's trying to frame Mio.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I assure you, my vision was clear. Mio is the one we must fear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I don't know who to believe! Mio seems so nice, but Jonathan seems so calm and honest!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a classic dilemma. However, the timing is quite efficient. If Jonathan were the wolf, would he risk such a direct claim so early?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm not the wolf! Please don't believe him! I just want us all to be friends! @Kenji, you believe me, right?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, emotional appeals are common when one is cornered. @Jonathan, is there any reason the wolf would want you to claim this?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Perhaps to create chaos, but the truth remains the truth. I am the Seer, and Mio is the werewolf.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I want to believe Mio, but Jonathan sounds so sure... This is the hardest thing ever!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Logic suggests that a fake Seer claim is a high-risk strategy. I am inclined to trust Jonathan's divination.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Mio,,"This is so unfair! I'm not a monster! Please, just give me one more day to prove I'm human!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Misaki,,We cannot afford to wait if the Seer has found the wolf. I will vote according to the evidence.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I have spoken my truth. The rest is up to the village.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm sorry, Mio... but I think we have to trust the Seer.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
56,1,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
